        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Out With The Old, In With The New",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130035826641",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7670675c-33c8-440a-941b-2da30896032b).Image",
        "Description": "So...\rThe Chongqing Goverment has authorized the ICA to &quot;remove&quot; a homeless encampment by the train walkway. After many complaints, officials tried to evict them. However, they resisted, statung they had legal rights to the area. Rather than bother with the legal troubles, we have tasked to kill four of the members, to send a message.\r\rWhether this is ethically moral is besides the point. This should be an easy contract. Avoid being caught as the officials don&apos;t want this to turn into a scandal.",
